          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 78314,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salah satu cara untuk mengulangi baris kode adalah menulisnya berulang kali, tetapi itu membutuhkan waktu yang sangat lama jika kita ingin membuat program yang lebih besar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>and again</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu dapat mengulangi baris dengan menulisnya lagi, tetapi ini lama untuk program besar. Buat baris terakhir mencetak <code>and again</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and again\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>\"and again\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 3",
            "id": 78313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membuat program dan situs web yang lebih besar, kita mengulangi baris kode menggunakan <strong>while loop</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>while</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop <code>while</code> mengulangi blok kodenya saat kondisi <code>True</code> dan berhenti saat kondisi <code>False</code>.</p><p>Gunakan <code>while</code> dan pilih kondisi agar <code>and again</code> terus dicetak selamanya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>while</code>, diikuti oleh <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "While loop",
            "id": 78310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menggunakan loop while untuk mengulangi baris kode dimulai dengan keyword <code>while</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>while</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "While loop",
            "id": 78309,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop while mengulangi blok kodenya selama kondisinya <code>True</code>. Kita menulis kondisi <code>True</code> dengan <code>True</code> diikuti titik dua <code>:</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>True:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "While loop",
            "id": 78308,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode yang diulangi oleh loop <code>while</code> berada setelah <code>:</code>, di dalam blok kode yang diindentasi. Seperti pernyataan <code>print()</code> di sini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print(\"and again\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode yang diulang loop <code>while</code> berada setelah <code>:</code> di dalam blok yang diindentasi. Tambahkan baris yang menampilkan <code>and again</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and again\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"and again\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "While loop",
            "id": 78312,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kondisi loop <code>while</code> selalu <code>True</code>, kita menyebutnya <strong>infinite loop</strong> karena loop tersebut akan berjalan tanpa batas, seperti pada <code>print()</code> di sini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>\"and again\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kondisi loop <code>while</code> tetap <code>True</code> selamanya, kita menyebutnya infinite loop.</p><p>Susun pemanggilan yang terus mencetak <code>and again</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and again\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>\"and again\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Crashing your program",
            "id": 78311,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karena kita tidak bisa menampilkan pesan <code>and again</code> tanpa batas di console, <code>...</code> menunjukkan bahwa kode berjalan selamanya dan membuat program kamu crash.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;and again&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"and again\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: While keyword",
            "id": 78306,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kata kunci apa yang kita gunakan untuk membuat perulangan while?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>while</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>if</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>while</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menggunakan kata kunci <code>while</code> untuk membuat while loop. Game harus berulang selama pemain punya nyawa. Baris mana yang memulai loop?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>while lives &gt; 0:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>while lives == 0:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>while lives </code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>while lives &gt; 0:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 78305,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita tahu kapan perulangan <code>while</code> akan berhenti?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan memeriksa kondisinya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dengan memeriksa keyword-nya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan memeriksa kondisinya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop menggunakan <code>while energy &gt; 0:</code> dan menurunkan <code>energy</code> setiap kali. Apa yang menunjukkan kapan loop berhenti?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop berhenti saat <code>energy &gt; 0</code> menjadi <code>False</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop berhenti saat Python mencapai kata kunci <code>while</code> lagi.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Loop berhenti setelah satu kali karena kondisi hanya diperiksa di awal.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Loop berhenti saat <code>energy &gt; 0</code> menjadi <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Code block",
            "id": 78304,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sebutan untuk kode yang diindentasi setelah <code>False:</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Echo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Blok kode</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sebuah kondisi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Blok kode.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kamu mengubah <code>False</code> menjadi <code>True</code>, apa yang dilakukan blok kode yang diindentasi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Echo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mencetak <code>Echo</code> berulang kali.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mencetak <code>Echo</code> sekali, lalu berhenti.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Terus melewati <code>print(\"Echo\")</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mencetak <code>Echo</code> berulang kali.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Infinite loop",
            "id": 78303,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sebutan untuk loop yang terus mengulang selamanya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop tak terbatas</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop while</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Loop tak terbatas.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah loop menggunakan <code>while True:</code> dan tidak ada di dalamnya yang mengubah kondisi. Loop jenis apa itu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop tak terbatas</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop yang berjalan satu kali</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Loop yang dilewati</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Loop tak terbatas.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Crashing your webpage",
            "id": 78302,
            "contentType": "interactive",
