            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang terjadi ketika kondisi loop <code>while</code> ini tetap <code>True</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop mengulang terus-menerus dan membuat program mengalami crash</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop menjalankan blok kodenya satu kali</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Loop mengulang terus-menerus dan membuat program mengalami crash.</p></body></html>",
